{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222090","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1522209001:0":{"text":"너희들은... 부관님을 따라다니던... 나, 난 게으름 피운 거 아니야! 진짜 열심히 나눠주고 있었어!","source_cn":"你们是跟着副将的那些人……我、我没有偷懒！我在认真发粮食！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A559CFE623C7FF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522209002:0":{"text":"긴장하지 마세요. 구호 식량의 배급 상황이 궁금했을 뿐이에요.","source_cn":"不必紧张，我们只是好奇赈灾粮的发放情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7A3A3BECE9131D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522209003:0":{"text":"하지만 너희랑 같이 다니는 루나애니 때문에... 말 못 해.","source_cn":"但是你们还带着一个兽人……我不能说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7449C3F832BF855B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522209004:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog93>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC693D3730DDCF945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1522209004":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog93>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC693D3730DDCF945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522209005:0":{"text":"저희가 궁금한 건 구호 식량의 배급에 관한 거지, 보칼리스의 군사 기밀이 아니에요.","source_cn":"我们询问的只是赈灾粮的情况，绝非呼临城的军事机密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB8B4558FBF53D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522209006:1":{"text":"마법사 협회의 명예를 걸고 장담하죠. 이 정보가 아쿠보르의 귀에 들어간다고 해도 아무런 영향을 주지 못할 거예요.","source_cn":"我以魔法师协会的品格担保，即使这些信息流向战场，传入雅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883218173E1268FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522209007:0":{"text":"마법사 협회...\n성을 자주 드나든다는 마법사가 혹시...?","source_cn":"魔法师协会……\\n你就是那个经常来城里的魔法师？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2A6B27A1F760B4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522209008:0":{"text":"맞습니다.","source_cn":"正是。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x547FB780909271DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522209009:0":{"text":"여러 사람의 병을 고쳐줬다고 하니... 그래. 뭐, 어차피 비밀도 아니니까 말이야.","source_cn":"我听说你给不少人都治过病……好吧，反正也没什么机密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2301DD795396D36D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522209010:0":{"text":"가뭄과 기근이 시작된 이후로 <style=\"highlight\">성 안의 식량이 점점 부족해졌어</style>. 특히 루나애니 토벌에 나선 뒤로 비축된 식량 대부분을 전선으로 보내서 더 부족했지.","source_cn":"自打闹了旱灾和饥荒，<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5261F066B476C753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522209011:1":{"text":"처음에는 그래도 구호 식량을 자주 배급한 편이었는데, 전쟁이 끝나질 않으니까 예전처럼 쉽게 나눠줄 수 없게 됐어...","source_cn":"最开始赈灾粮发放得还算频繁。但战争一直没结束，我们已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33654934B40B31B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522209012:0":{"text":"이번에도 사실, 계획에 없던 배급이었는데 영주님이 특별히 나눠주라고 명령하신 거래.","source_cn":"就拿这次来说吧。这次的赈灾粮是领主特意下令，在原本的计...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51920B87F2660BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522209013:0":{"text":"의원들은 다 반대했다고 하는데 <style=\"highlight\">지휘관님이 반대를 무릅쓰고 추진했다고 들었어</style>.","source_cn":"据说议事官们起初都不同意，<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86BAA02473CFE188","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522209014:0":{"text":"전쟁 중이니까 밥도 먹지 말라는 거야? 정말 대단한 국정 운영 방식이네.","source_cn":"为了打仗不叫人吃饭？这治邦之道还真是有意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC28BC400EAC4747A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","do